  "review": {
    "note": "The manual official upstream release-note review recorded on 2026-10-23 remains applicable to the unchanged dependency manifest: hatchling 1.32.4, distlib 0.4.4, packaging 26.3, build 1.6.1, mypy 2.4.0, pytest 9.1.1, pytest-xdist 3.8.0, Ruff 0.17.2, and markdownlint-cli2 0.24.0. That review checked Hatch plugin/metadata corrections, launcher/archive containment, packaging parser and range APIs, build Windows symlink correction, mypy native-parser/macOS x86_64 wheel changes, pytest conftest fixes, xdist scheduling, Ruff syntax/lint fixes, and markdownlint dependency updates. This fresh canonical audit is compared item-for-item with those reviewed versions; a changed latest version requires new upstream review before commit. All reviewed latest stable versions satisfy existing lower bounds, with no excluded latest version or identified upper-bound requirement. Current package metadata permits Python 3.14; xdist requires >=3.9 without an explicit 3.14 classifier. markdownlint-cli2 requires Node >=22. The new v9 worktree was rebuilt normally with Python 3.14.8, Node 24.22.0 and the same reviewed dependencies. Formal Docker CSV encoding, raw RECORD inventory repair and scope-lock deadline fixes add no dependencies or bound changes. The task preserves existing V3 feature/formal/build content, adds the targeted process fix and 50,000-token integration policy, and generates one audit for its single 0.9.0 release. Exact-candidate full gate and native Windows execution are separate evidence; failed review receipts are not reused.",
